URL=https://github.com/sakura-ryoko/minihud/issues/new?title=Villager%20info%20text%20plate%20never%20attaches%20to%20the%20job%20site%20on%20multiplayer%20servers%20(JOB_SITE%20brain%20memory%20is%20server-side%20only)&body=Environment%0A-%20Client%3A%20MiniHUD%200.41.2%20(26.3)%20%2B%20malilib%200.30.2%2C%20Fabric%0A-%20Server%3A%20Paper%2FFolia-based%20server%20(Minecraft%2026.3)%0A%20%20The%20server%20is%20Bukkit%2FPaper-based%2C%20so%20the%20Servux%20mod%20itself%20cannot%20be%20installed%20there.%0A%20%20Instead%20a%20server-side%20plugin%20implements%20the%20same%20servux%3Aentity_data%20protocol%0A%20%20(metadata%20handshake%20%2B%20entity%20requests)%2C%20byte-compatible%20with%20Servux.%0A%0AWhat%20happens%0A-%20Singleplayer%3A%20the%20villager%20info%20text%20plate%20snaps%20to%20the%20villager's%20job%20site%20(lectern)%0A%20%20when%20the%20villager%20is%20within%201.7%20blocks%20%E2%80%94%20works%20as%20intended.%0A-%20Multiplayer%3A%20the%20plate%20always%20follows%20the%20villager%20and%20never%20attaches%20to%20the%20lectern%2C%0A%20%20even%20when%20the%20villager%20stands%20right%20next%20to%20%2F%20on%20top%20of%20it.%0A%0AWhy%20(from%20the%20sources)%0A-%20OverlayRendererVillagerInfo.renderAtEntity()%20reads%3A%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20living.getBrain().getMemoryInternal(MemoryModuleType.JOB_SITE)%0A-%20%60living%60%20comes%20from%20EntityUtils.getEntitiesByClass()%3A%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20ids%20are%20collected%20from%20mc.level%2C%20then%20resolved%20via%20WorldUtils.getBestWorld(mc)%0A-%20WorldUtils.getBestWorld()%20returns%20the%20integrated%20server's%20level%20when%20one%20exists%2C%0A%20%20otherwise%20mc.level%3A%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20singleplayer%20-%3E%20server-side%20entity%20%20-%3E%20real%20brain%20%20-%3E%20JOB_SITE%20present%20-%3E%20attaches%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20multiplayer%20%20-%3E%20client-side%20entity%20%20-%3E%20vanilla%20never%20syncs%20brain%20memories%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%3E%20JOB_SITE%20always%20empty%20-%3E%20branch%20is%20dead%0A%0ASuggestion%0A-%20The%20entity%20data%20MiniHUD%20already%20requests%20from%20Servux%20(servux%3Aentity_data%2C%20types%204%2F6)%0A%20%20contains%20%22Brain%22%3A%20the%20server%20side%20serialises%20entities%20with%20Entity%23saveWithoutId(...)%2C%0A%20%20which%20writes%20TAG_BRAIN%20including%20the%20packed%20%60minecraft%3Ajob_site%60%20memory.%0A-%20So%20the%20plate%20position%20could%20be%20derived%20from%20the%20cached%20NBT%0A%20%20(e.g.%20Brain.memories.%22minecraft%3Ajob_site%22.value)%20instead%20of%20the%20local%20entity's%20brain%2C%0A%20%20which%20would%20make%20the%20feature%20work%20on%20multiplayer%20servers%20too.%0A-%20Alternatively%2C%20applying%20the%20received%20Brain%20tag%20to%20the%20client-side%20entity%20would%20make%20the%0A%20%20existing%20check%20work%20as-is%20%E2%80%94%20note%20there%20is%20already%20an%20IMixinEntity%20exposing%0A%20%20readAdditionalSaveData%20that%20currently%20has%20no%20callers.
